{"song": "The.madpix.project_-_One_Way_Street", "config": "final_patched", "model": "models/asr", "seconds": 171.0, "maxNewTokens": 368, "elapsed": 179.05159521102905, "exit": 0, "chunks": [{"index": 0, "offset": 0.0, "length": 34.05, "raw": "\"Tears are like diamonds in my eyes. Light me up. Now you're out of sight. It's enough. It's too late to break the silence. In a rose-colored view of us, I got lost. Could I reach?\""}, {"index": 4, "offset": 124.69, "length": 33.41, "raw": "\"A one-way street.\""}, {"index": 3, "offset": 92.84, "length": 31.85, "raw": "\"Freely, baby, can't you see we run out of time chasing happiness while you get what you need. There's nothing left of us but bleeding blades and knives tonight. You'll know how it feels. A one-way street. That's how you leave. Why do you always take and never give? I'll walk away to help you see our love is falling down so easily. A one-way street.\""}, {"index": 1, "offset": 34.05, "length": 30.87, "raw": "\"All your lies, all your lies would be blades and knives. Just have me inside. Who will save you from this dark? Who will fix your selfish heart? A one-way street. That's how you live. Why do you always take and never give?\""}, {"index": 2, "offset": 64.92, "length": 27.92, "raw": "\"Wide awake, yeah, I've crossed the line. I'm coming home. I'm running back to real life, to the start where I could breathe in.\""}, {"index": 5, "offset": 158.1, "length": 12.9, "raw": "\"You never give. I walk away so easily. One way street.\""}], "result": {"language": "English", "text": "Tears are like diamonds in my eyes. Light me up. Now you're out of sight. It's enough. It's too late to break the silence. In a rose-colored view of us, I got lost. Could I reach?All your lies, all your lies would be blades and knives. Just have me inside. Who will save you from this dark? Who will fix your selfish heart? A one-way street. That's how you live. Why do you always take and never give?Wide awake, yeah, I've crossed the line.